<TR><TD><font size=+1 color=FFFFFF>Halfings Unite<BR></font>
<font color =FFFFFF><P>
"Boombrakh Growli is leading a small but growing force of halflings called 'The Protectors of Rivervale'. Are you a Halfling and proud of it? Would you like to protect the innocent from the growing threat from the Runny Eye Goblins, then sign up, mail Boombrakh at <a href=mailto:boombrakh@telia.com>boombrakh@telia.com</a> and tell him you want in! With your help Boombrakh will make this force official but he needs your support, make his dream for a better Rivervale come true!"

<BR>
 - Boombrakh Growli<BR><BR>
